{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>יָדַעְתִּי</b> — in gematria חמשה מלכים (five kings): that five kings came forth from Menasheh." "<b>וְזַרְעוֹ יִהְיֶה מְלֹא</b> — in gematria יהושע."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {0 "The gematria of ידעתי equals חמשה מלכים (= 395); the comment asserts that five kings descended from the tribe of Menasheh.", 1 "The gematria of וזרעו יהיה מלא equals יהושע (= 391)."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:37.126768669Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}